cinnamon-presets (0.20.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed the app icon not showing up after a .deb install: shipped
    under hicolor/scalable/apps now too, not just hicolor/128x128/apps.
    Also set the app's prgname explicitly on startup and added
    StartupWMClass to the .desktop file, so the window/taskbar icon
    reliably matches regardless of how the app was launched.
  * Redesigned the update banner: a rounded, on-brand card instead of
    GTK's plain default blue InfoBar, with a "Learn more" link to the
    release notes alongside the existing Update Now button.
  * New: after updating, the next launch shows a one-time "What's New"
    popup with the changelog entries since the version you were
    previously on.

 -- SaadTerminal <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

cinnamon-presets (0.19.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * .deb and AppImage packaging, with in-app self-update support for
    both (downloads the matching release asset and installs it via
    pkexec for .deb, or swaps the running AppImage file in place for
    AppImage).
  * Removed the GRUB "untested" warning and its apply-time cooldown
    now that it's been verified working end-to-end; LightDM, Plymouth,
    and GRUB now share one consistent confirmation dialog on apply.
  * Settings now opens on the General tab instead of About.
  * Switched from BETA-x.y version strings to this project's own X.Y.Z
    scheme (X: 0 = beta, 1 = release; Y: minor; Z: bugfix).

 -- SaadTerminal <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
